<div class="wp-block-wdl-lw-pr-custom-title-11 lw-pr-custom-title-11" style="--color-main:#0e5c55;--color-main-text:#ffffff;--color-sub-text:#cfe6e2;width:100%;margin:1em auto" id="data"><h2 class="ttl" style="border-radius:4px"><span class="sub">WHERE IS YOUR DATA</span><span class="main">データの置き場所と、守り方</span></h2></div>
